KERMIT-8

K08MIT.PAL is Kermit for the DEC PDP-8 with OS8 or RTS8 written in the PAL-8
assember by Jerry Sands and Randy Hippe of:

        Bureau of Engraving, Inc.
        3311 Broadway N.E.
        Minneapolis, MN  55413
        Phone 612-623-0900 x218

Implements the following commands:

        1.      CONNECT
        2.      BYE      /FOR SERVER KERMIT ONLY
        3.      EXIT
        4.      SEND
        5.      GET      /FOR SERVER KERMIT ONLY
        6.      RECEIVE
        7.      HELP

Supports wildcarding for "SEND" only.  (Sorry, this is all the documentation.)
